    [item=framing; model=deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash first_token=710ms wall=1.0s]
<<READY 01:23>>
[01:23] CANDIDATE: A small desktop agent runs on the laptop and the phone app is a thin client. Both connect out to my relay server, authenticate over HTTP and upgrade to a WebSocket, and the relay forwards commands from the phone to the agent and results back.
[01:48] INTERVIEWER: Makes sense. Why route through a relay server instead of connecting the phone directly to the laptop?
    [decision=opened candidate_intro with project probe <- Framing done; candidate gave intro and project description.; item=framing; model=deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash first_token=569ms wall=1.0s]
<<READY 01:48>>
